OL,3,GNEWSADorset coast under flood warning
OL,4,Aas storm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the Dorset coast is under
OL,7,Fa flood warning as Storm Austen sweeps
OL,8,Fin.
OL,10,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has issued
OL,11,Fthe warning for the coast in the
OL,12,FChiswell area with people urged to
OL,13,Favoid seafronts and harbours due to
OL,14,Fwave overtopping and spray containing
OL,15,Fdebris.
OL,17,FThe area under the flood warning also
OL,18,Fcovers Brandy Row, Pebble Lane,
OL,19,FVictoria Square up to the junction with
OL,20,FQueens Road and the car parks along the
OL,21,FA354 and the yard along Lerret Road.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
