OL,3,GNEWSADorset coast under flood warning
OL,4,Aas storm sweeps in
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A354 Portland Beach Road and the
OL,7,FCauseway was closed after flooding and
OL,8,Fwaves overtopped the road - it reopened
OL,9,Fshortly before 09:00 BST. Dorset
OL,10,FCouncil said the road would remain open
OL,11,Funless conditions deteriorate.
